   "design": "After each session the counselor speaks a short summary, and with consent a dictation tool drafts the note and GP letters; the counselor corrects every one, and a validator flags risk statements not in the summary. Risk and crisis notes are excluded from drafting. Progress reports start from a summary of the notes. Patients fill in questionnaires online and scores go into the record. Sessions are registered from the agenda, consent is signed electronically into the record, and missing items are flagged by rule. The check, sending and team discussion stay with the counselor.",
   "previous_blocker": "Notes were typed, scores and sessions retyped, forms scanned.",
   "enabler_now": "Dictation into the record, online questionnaires and agenda-linked registration.",
